{"id":"1357109635489046528","date":"2021-02-03","url":"https://x.com/bobmcgrewai/status/1357109635489046528","author":"bobmcgrewai","text":"Transfer in neural networks isn't the black box we thought it was - instead, you can predict it with a simple model. Very excited about this work from @Hernandez_Danny!","quoted":{"url":"https://x.com/Hernandez_Danny/status/1357035777406853128","text":"AI systems often use more direct experience than a human could get in a lifetime. Humans require less experience, because they \"transfer\" past experience to new tasks. Recent work I led found an equation to characterize transfer in a simple setting.\n\nhttps://t.co/2OezsOi8lV\n\n👇 https://t.co/5GVEwV6Z3o"},"live_status":200,"archived_at":"20210203233215","archive":"https://web.archive.org/web/20210203233215/https://twitter.com/bobmcgrewai/status/1357109635489046528","via":"wayback","read_at":"2026-09-30"}
{"id":"1346673019037442048","date":"2021-01-06","url":"https://x.com/bobmcgrewai/status/1346673019037442048","author":"ilyasut","other_author":"ilyasut","quoted":{"url":"https://x.com/OpenAI/status/1346541909443952640","text":"We’ve developed two neural networks which have learned by associating text and images. CLIP maps images into categories described in text, and DALL-E creates new images, like this, from text. \n\nA step toward systems with deeper understanding of the world. https://t.co/rppy6u1zcn https://t.co/MNVlo8LZbV"},"live_status":200,"archived_at":"20210106042057","archive":"https://web.archive.org/web/20210106042057/https://twitter.com/bobmcgrewai/status/1346673019037442048","via":"wayback","read_at":"2026-09-30"}
